+## F28. Aggregate checked rename across dependent Composer contexts
+
+Checked rename refuses a proposal when another witnessed semantic graph consumes
+an edited declaration. Aggregate and reconcile that graph's references before
+allowing the shared declaration to change. Preserve every open source receipt,
+PHP target and physical source authority; unknown or conflicting graphs must
+remain unavailable. Cover two apps sharing a path package, unsaved consumers,
+configuration changes, aliases, cancellation and incomplete graph discovery.
